  "historyNote": "#150, eff 1-9-74; amd by #741, eff 1-18-76; amd by #1058.10-1058.12, eff 1-22-77; amd by #1301, eff 1-10-79; amd by #1410.6, eff 8-1-79; amd by #1579, eff 5-15-80; amd by #1713, eff 2-9-81; amd by #2002, eff 4-19-82; amd by #2058, eff 6-22-82; ss by #2209, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2208, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2781, eff 7-26-84; amd by #2480, eff 8-31-84; amd by #4374, eff 2-24-88; amd by #4812, eff 5-3-90; ss by #4867, eff 7-19-90; amd by #5127, eff 4-29-91; ss by 5393, eff 5-12-92; ss by #6160, eff 1-3-96; amd by #6455, eff 2-19-97; amd by #6944, eff 2-24-99; ss by #7890, eff 5-19-03; ss by #7987, eff 1-3-04; amd by #8634, eff 5-23-06; EXPIRED: 1-3-12 (except for (a) intro. and entry for “Diflubenzuron” in Table 7.1) New. #10489, INTERIM, eff 12-17-13, EXPIRED: 6-16-14 New. #10712, eff 11-5-14; ss by #14064, eff 8-22-24; ss by #14333, eff 8-1-25, EXPIRES: 8-1-35",
